Description: The identity of the Total.js Developer Distros: boot splash
 The boot splash of the Total.js Developer Distros: the logo comes together and a
 ring of light follows the progress of the boot. It makes it the theme of Plymouth
 and asks the kernel for a quiet, graphical boot.
